<Layout title="Joan Mas Lloret">
	<h1>Hello! I'm Joan Mas Lloret</h1>

	<img src="src/assets/foto.jpg" alt="Joan Mas Lloret" width="200" height="200" />

	<p>I am a software engineer, with a focus on DevOps and platform engineering.</p>

	<h2>A little about me</h2>

	<p>Since I was a kid, I've always loved technology and computers. I've also always loved biology, which led my to study biochemistry and biomedical science.<br />
	As the lab is not the place for a clumsy person such as me, I self-taught my way back into computers.<br />
	I am from València, Spain.</p>

	<p>
		<a href="/blog">Blog</a> · <a href="/cv">CV</a>
	</p>

	<style>
		html,
		body {
			margin: 0;
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
		}

		body {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
			text-align: center;
			min-height: 100vh;
			padding: 2rem 2rem 3rem;
			box-sizing: border-box;
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
